# Plan index

This folder holds one plan for each component of {{PROJECT}}.

Rules:

1. Use the [plan template](_template.md) for each new plan.
2. Record each important decision as an ADR in [`docs/adr/`](../adr/).
3. After each change to a plan, add an entry to the [work log](../log/README.md).
4. If an idea can change the scope, put it through the [revisit log](../log/REVISIT.md). Only {{DECIDER}} decides.

